WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.583
A migration from vue-i18n
replaces each $t lookup with its

2
00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:06.523
source text.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:12.421
General Translation's gt-vue
runs next to vue-i18n as you move

4
00:00:12.421 --> 00:00:13.778
components inline.

5
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:20.165
Install gt-vue, and sync the
active locale into vue-i18n.

6
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.076
Then move one component at a time,

7
00:00:23.076 --> 00:00:26.187
from keys to inline
copy in the T component.

8
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.227
For static strings such as titles,

9
00:00:30.227 --> 00:00:33.222
call useGT inside a computed.

10
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:38.979
Run npx gt translate, and General
Translation translates moved

11
00:00:38.979 --> 00:00:41.149
copy with its template as context.

12
00:00:41.549 --> 00:00:43.906
Your team can correct
it in the Dashboard,

13
00:00:43.906 --> 00:00:47.016
and unmoved components keep
their reviewed messages.

14
00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.319
Your team now ships
Russian with each release.
